  "notes": "West leads the ♦K against 4♠. The defense starts with 3 rounds of diamonds. South ruffs the third round. South should plan to draw trump and run the hearts. South does not mind losing a trump trick, but he must be careful not to lose trump control.\n\nIf South plays a spade to the ♠K and takes a spade finesse, West may be able to win the ♠Q and force the South hand in diamonds again. If trumps are 4-2, the defense will take a second trump trick.\n\nSouth can ensure the contract if spades are no worse than 4-2. South should lead a low spade at trick 2 and, when West follows low, play the ♠2 from dummy. East is welcome to win the ♠Q. Dummy's ♠K will be able to handle further forces in diamonds. South will be able to retain control and draw trump.\n\nIf East follows low on the first round of trump, the ♠K is cashed. South crosses in hearts and plays the ♠A. If the ♠Q is still outstanding, South runs the hearts, allowing the defense to take the ♠Q whenever they wish. South will have a trump remaining to handle further diamond forces.",
  "commentary_paragraphs": [
    "West leads the ♦K against 4♠. The defense starts with 3 rounds of diamonds. South ruffs the third round. South should plan to draw trump and run the hearts. South does not mind losing a trump trick, but he must be careful not to lose trump control.",
    "If South plays a spade to the ♠K and takes a spade finesse, West may be able to win the ♠Q and force the South hand in diamonds again. If trumps are 4-2, the defense will take a second trump trick.",
    "South can ensure the contract if spades are no worse than 4-2. South should lead a low spade at trick 2 and, when West follows low, play the ♠2 from dummy. East is welcome to win the ♠Q. Dummy's ♠K will be able to handle further forces in diamonds. South will be able to retain control and draw trump.",
    "If East follows low on the first round of trump, the ♠K is cashed. South crosses in hearts and plays the ♠A. If the ♠Q is still outstanding, South runs the hearts, allowing the defense to take the ♠Q whenever they wish. South will have a trump remaining to handle further diamond forces."
  ],
